Lambent Armor is a set of [[Bard]] specific armor obtained through quests offered in the [[The Temple of Solusek Ro]].

The level range for the quests are around the low 20s to mid 30s depending on your resources. Each piece requires a [[Lambent Stone]] (drops from Hill Giants, Griffons ~level 33) which can bought from higher level players (around 20-35pp). 

'''Note:'''  A seven-piece visible set of Lambent armor costs approximately 1600pp to quest when purchasing gems and lambent stones from vendors.

== Rewards ==

